hived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-09-03T00:17:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T21:06:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: `Godot 4.8-dev4_mono`, `4.7.2-stable_mono`\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8266) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9700 CPU @ 3.00GHz (8 threads) - 15.93 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing the Direct3D 12 renderer often results in a framerate several times lower than using the Vulkan renderer (Windows).\n\nIn the MRP, the framerate for Vulkan is ~37, and the framerate for Direct3D 12 is ~3. Which means that Direct3D 12 is 90% slower for me. This is problematic because Direct3D 12 was made the default renderer.\n\nWhen I hide the gizmos (making the blue collision outlines invisible), the framerate for Vulkan is ~39 and the framerate for Direct3D 12 is ~31. Not as significant, but still 20% slower for Direct3D 12.\n\nVulkan:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1032\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b346b0e-9733-499d-b225-df799840298c\" />\n\nDirect3D 12:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1032\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7caf39c8-ae69-47ea-99f2-a1f369f391d7\" />\n\nThe MRP example is not really realistic (it has 500 chair models in the same place), but I did experience a significant performance reduction in my own project as well (600 FPS with Vulkan, 180 FPS with Direct3D 12).\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Use Windows\n- Add some props to your scene\n- Compare Direct3D 12 and Vulkan framerate\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31762131/new-game-project.zip)\n\n(chair model by nickvarts: https://skfb.ly/6XWyD)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123125/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123125/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}